          "kind": "skill",
          "schemaName": "msftcat_ITSupportTranscriptDemo.skill.log-support-ticket_l0q",
          "description": "Handle an explicit request to log or create an IT support ticket, or an explicit request to retry a ticket submission. Use the Log ticket tool with the user's issue details and let its pre-tool hook supply any available conversation transcript. Do not invoke this procedure for ordinary troubleshooting or general questions about tickets."
        }
